<td id="A1.T7.2.2.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T7.2.2.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Choice</span>: library <span id="A1.T7.2.2.2.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(distractor)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.2.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.2.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T7.2.2.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Con Rationale:</span> While a mall is a common place for multiple</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.2.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.2.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">clothing stores, it is implausible to consider it the specific</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.2.2.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.2.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">answer because a fashion district or online marketplaces might</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.2.2.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.2.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">have far more clothing stores concentrated in one place.</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.2.2.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.2.2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Human Rating <math id="A1.T7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="A1.T7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="+0.6" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+0.6</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
