</table></td>
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<table id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Context</span>: Cameron wasted money on an expensive handbag.</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Question</span>: Why did Cameron do this?</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Choice</span>: resent her waste <span id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(distractor)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Con Rationale:</span> It is implausible that Cameron would waste</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">money on an expensive handbag with the intention of</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">resenting her waste because typically, people do not make</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">financial decisions to purposefully feel negative emotions like</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">resentment. Such a motive is counterproductive and irrational,</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">as purchases are usually made for positive reasons such as</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">necessity, desire, or status, not to induce regret.</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Human Rating <math id="A1.T7.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="A1.T7.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="+1.6" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+1.6</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">LLM Rating <math id="A1.T7.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> (OpenAI): <math id="A1.T7.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-0.62" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.62</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-0.62</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.3.2.1.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">LLM Rating <math id="A1.T7.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> (Non-OpenAI): <math id="A1.T7.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-0.11" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-0.11</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
</table></td></tr>
