<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<table id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Context</span>: Riley layered down their arms with a blanket to keep</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">warm.</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Question</span>: What does Riley need to do before this?</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Choice</span>: get a blanket from the closet <span id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.4.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(gold label)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Con Rationale:</span> It is implausible that Riley needs to get a blanket</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">from the closet because the sentence implies that the blanket is</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">already in their possession, suggesting that any necessary</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">retrieval must have already occurred. Additionally, there is no</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">indication that Riley is not near a blanket or lacks access to one</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">already placed conveniently nearby.</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Human Rating <math id="A1.T7.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="A1.T7.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-3.2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-3.2</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">LLM Rating <math id="A1.T7.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> (OpenAI): <math id="A1.T7.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1.38" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1.38</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1.38</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T7.2.4.2.1.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">LLM Rating <math id="A1.T7.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> (Non-OpenAI): <math id="A1.T7.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-0.78" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.78</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-0.78</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
</table></td></tr>
