<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Examples from <span id="A1.T7.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SIQA</span> and <span id="A1.T7.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CQA</span> showing mean plausibility rating changes for different agents for <span id="A1.T7.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">CON Rationales.</span> We observed no cases where there was a decrease in Human ratings, but decrease in LLM ratings.</figcaption>
</figure>
