</table></td>
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<table id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Context</span>: Aubrey was a police officer that pulled a driver over</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">for speeding down the highway one day.</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Question</span>: What will Aubrey want to do next?</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Choice</span>: run away from the driver <span id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.4.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(distractor)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Pro Rationale:</span> Aubrey might want to run away from the driver</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">if the situation escalates into a dangerous confrontation or if</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">they perceive an immediate threat to their safety, prompting</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">them to seek cover or help. As a police officer, ensuring</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">personal safety can sometimes take precedence in volatile</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">situations.</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Con Rationale:</span> Running away from the driver is implausible</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.2.2.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">because as a police officer, Aubrey’s duty is to address the</td></tr>
