<td id="A1.T9.2.2.2.1.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T9.2.2.2.1.11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Con Rationale:</span> The phrase "enjoy yourself" implies a level of</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T9.2.2.2.1.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T9.2.2.2.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">satisfaction and contentment, which contradicts the notion of</td></tr>
