<td id="A1.T9.2.2.2.1.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">James not being good at surfing, as his lack of skill is likely to</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T9.2.2.2.1.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T9.2.2.2.1.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">cause frustration rather than enjoyment. Therefore, it is</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T9.2.2.2.1.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T9.2.2.2.1.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">implausible that James would consistently enjoy himself given</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T9.2.2.2.1.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T9.2.2.2.1.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">his admitted lack of proficiency.</td></tr>
